WEBVTT

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.520
Kisara!

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.750
That just now...

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.630
Shu!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.800
Shu! Get on!

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.900
Go, Shu.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:48.520
But...

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.870
Kisara!

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.740
Kisara!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:19.970
It can't be!

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:56.730
EPISODE 11
GENTLE FOOLISH LIES

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.230
This is the worst!

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.730
A girl?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.820
And it's even worse now!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.590
Th-This means...

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:17.300
ALARM

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.510
ALARM

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.220
What...

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.350
What are you looking at?

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.130
You're kidding me!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.220
Hold on!

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:45.550
Kisara!

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:55.480
Get out of our way!
Are you going to kill your own big brother?

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.200
Second shot has hit the target!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.910
The demon has stopped moving!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.790
Immediately launch
the third shot! Hurry!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.500
B-But any more successive shots...

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.040
It won't last much longer anyway!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.420
O-Okay!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.670
What?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.920
Oh, so you're going to save them.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.680
They are citizens of this City.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:31.680
If they break the law, I'll arrest them.
And if their lives are in danger, I'll rescue them.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:34.680
That's the duty of a government, isn't it?

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.940
Well, indeed so.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.940
That said, I don't think
it would be appreciated at all.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:45.440
After all, this makes me
the guy who killed his little sister.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:14.810
<i>As a result...</i>

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:19.310
"VOLCANIC PLUMES CAN BE SEEN"
ACTIVE UNDERWATER VOLCANO
IN THE NORTHWEST OF BAYRON CITY

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:19.310
<i>Bayron City Airport is currently stopping
the departure and arrival of all flights.</i>

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:25.400
<i>Other public transit
has paused operation, as well.</i>

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.400
Will they be able to cover all of it up this time?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.780
<i>The next news item...</i>

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.200
What did the doctor say?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.120
No heartbeat, no brainwaves, nothing.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:43.130
And wounds that previously
would've been gone instantaneously

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.800
aren't healed even after several hours.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.460
This has never happened before.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:53.930
Even then, we humans can't conclude
that she'll never wake up again.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.470
You're aware of that, right?

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.980
That thing is...

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.980
a monster that had lived for centuries
with a blade piercing her chest.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.900
And what about Kanna?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:14.450
The Abbey's artificial satellite
had observed everything that happened.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.450
She sank 500 meters
to the south of that island

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:22.290
and has ceased activity
200 meters below the surface.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:25.250
What are the chances
she'll never wake up again?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:28.710
We can't make any conclusions, of course.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:34.050
But she's also a monster that had lived
for years skewered by a lance.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:37.720
Chances are very likely
that this is nothing but a small break.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.020
Is she a demon? Or is she human?

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:45.060
She can become a calamity
far greater than a Demonically Possessed,

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:48.980
but there's also a possibility
that she can live that life as a good person.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.740
Which way will she go?
I can't make a generalization.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.620
However, the Celestial Abbey has already...

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.120
deemed Kanna Ogata as an S-Class demon.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.370
S-Class?

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:07.000
In the future, it won't be just me.
Other agents will be after her life.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.590
But I'm not sure
if this city will last that long.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:15.090
What will we do if she appears again?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.350
With Kisara like this...

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:21.390
who'll be able to go up
against an S-Class demon?

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.730
That's decided...

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.900
by that government
you guys love and respect so much.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.820
I see! I see!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.950
An underwater volcano erupted.
That's a big deal.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.830
And who the hell's going to believe this?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.870
Foreign governments
already know about the situation.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.210
The fact that a giant demon appeared
in the seas near the City

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.210
and that it was shot down
by a satellite weapon.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.090
Any inquiries from other countries?

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.840
We have a mountain of inquiries of course.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.340
But I left my father
to deal with all of them.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.350
As you know, he's clueless like always...

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.600
so there's no fear that he'll accidentally
leak our top secrets.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.390
I see.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.770
So, you can hold out
on your end a bit longer.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.020
But it's all over for you...

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.860
Director General.

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:14.360
Concealing a demon,
violating the Heavy Weapons Act

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.240
and firing at the deputy mayor with a tank...

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.870
How are you going to take
responsibility, Mikhail?

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.000
The concealing was all of our doing.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.540
Because Sis Lin did something unnecessary and
that made the situation even more complicated—

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.000
This is not the time to be talking
about where the responsibility lies.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.260
Wait, I was almost killed by this guy!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.010
So, Mikhail...

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.510
Will you be able to defeat
that demon next time?

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.310
That would be—

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.770
Wait, Sis Shen!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.140
That's a human!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.440
I heard from Ayano.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:53.900
She's Kanna Ogata, the one presumed dead
despite the lack of a corpse 12 years ago.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.650
She was a resident of this city.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:01.950
But now, she has about as much power
as an S-Class demon if not more.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.540
She's truly the root of the Demon Hazards.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.960
If she has the ability
to communicate like Kisara,

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:11.170
we still have the means to take
countermeasures as a government.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.590
So, those whose lives
got screwed up 12 years ago...

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.300
are going to be lost again?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.190
Two B-Class. Five C-Class. As for D-Class...

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.520
We've earned like two years' worth.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.820
We can goof off for a while
without working.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.900
But I'm surprised we were able
to hold them all down.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.700
On top of it, we did it all
without AAA, the largest company.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.990
It's because my drone squad
deftly led them along.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.500
That's why we were able
to get them all together at the airport.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:51.580
You're not going to whine about
how we're gonna split the reward, are you?

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.960
We decided in the beginning, right? The number
and class of the Demonically Possessed we defeat—

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.090
We don't have the luxury
to talk about stuff like that.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:03.470
These were simply minions
that spawned from an S-Class demon.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:07.850
And that S-Class is still alive and well
on the ocean floor.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:11.350
To see this as a time to cash in
or a time to quit...

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:15.900
You can count me out. I can't even imagine
going up against an S-Class.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:19.570
If we're able to defeat it, I could probably
goof off for the rest of my life.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:23.120
But if we can't defeat it,
we and the city will be exterminated.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.370
A difficult decision.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.790
Even then, this is still our city.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.790
But Dominic,
you weren't born here, were you?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.300
Of course not!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.380
No matter how you look at it,
he's older than this city!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:42.590
But after all this time,
living anywhere else...

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:47.140
Oh, even if we are gone,
Kisara will still be around.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.190
Let's have a demon defeat the demon.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.900
Hey, Kisara...

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:02.320
I don't know what I should do anymore.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.030
What am I fighting for?

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:07.620
Who am I fighting for?

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.580
Tell me, Kisara.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.920
What should I do?

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.710
In that remote land where nobody lives...

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:20.420
In that cave where I first met you...
Should I just live together with you?

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:27.390
Abandon the city, abandon my friends, abandon
my family and just be together with you...

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.640
Family?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.850
Did I even have a family?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.900
I don't care about any of that.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:45.160
You can forget about everything
other than me.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:50.040
I'll take care of you forever.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.250
Kisara...

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.840
Shu...

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.590
You've fought enough already.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.970
So, promise me...

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.680
that you won't fight that demon anymore.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.810
That you'll flee from this city.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:15.810
Yeah.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.860
Let's go together.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.320
You're not capable
of doing that though.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:21.610
Huh?

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.690
Nothing.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.490
Then, you don't need them anymore, right?

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.790
You don't need your memories, right?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.160
Nope.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:36.080
I'll give it all to you, soul and all.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.420
You're okay with that?

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.090
That was the original promise, wasn't it?

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.840
And you've given me plenty already.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.420
You're right.

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.440
Kisara, you—

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.450
You're going to leave?

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.450
From my room?

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.200
No, from the city in general.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.700
No way! Why?

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:20.420
Because I don't think I can reach the truth
behind that incident like this.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.840
The Demonically Possessed
that we can defeat are D-Class at best.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:29.430
The higher classes, like those who might've been
involved in that incident, are all left running loose.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.560
Is it because I'm terrible at every chore?

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.680
Because I leave you to do everything?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.480
No, that's not what this is about.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.350
Or rather, I really appreciate what you do.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.110
You pay for all of our living expenses.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.030
A-A-Ayano...

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.280
I heard from my dad in the past...

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:57.200
that I have a distant relative
who's half-demon and half-human.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.000
I see.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:05.210
So, it was your family that sealed away
the nameless demon inside that cave.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.420
I didn't think the Abbey would catch on.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:17.350
In the story passed down in my family,
it was a child born several hundred years ago

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.690
when my ancestor seduced a phantom
that was causing a riot in a certain village.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.440
So, how you don't discriminate between
any women seems to run in your blood.

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:32.660
Wanna team up? You want to know
the location where the demon is sealed away.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.620
I want more combat power.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.330
I'll give you all of the bounty.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:39.250
But its head will be mine.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.500
Shu...

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.330
You betrayed me!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.670
Sorry!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.380
What I really wanted wasn't money.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.670
I'll kill you!

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.470
Someday, I will kill you!

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:01.140
Though distant, we're related by blood.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.980
The possibility of a contract is high.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.980
But a soul is a bit much.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.740
Is there something a bit simpler? Huh?

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.740
- SOUL
- MEMORIES
- LIFE SPAN
- FIVE SENSES

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.070
Memories?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.540
Let's see.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:22.460
As proof of contract, I'll give
my memories from three days ago.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.420
- SPECIFY A COST
- MUTUAL CONTRACT
- GIVE A NAME TO THE DEMON

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.420
A name?

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:28.420
Oh right, this is a contract.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.680
If that's the case,
your name starting today is Kisara.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:37.680
Isn't that a good name?
It's the name of the first person I kissed.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.230
Demon Kisara...

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:47.520
With my memories from three days ago
as payment, obey me.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.150
One hour will do.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.450
Shu...

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.630
You betrayed me.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:13.630
So, those are the first words
out of your mouth, I see!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.850
Wow!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.220
Kisara, that's Bayron City.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.560
The city brimming with your kind.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.070
What are you doing, Shu?
Wait, that girl—

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:10.480
I finally got permission to operate!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.690
It was a long battle!

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.940
What are you thinking?

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:17.910
Pummeling all the other companies
in the industry...

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.410
I had to do that
to make them admit it, right?

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.290
That Kisara and I are the strongest.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.830
Well, AAA is pretty good, too, you know!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.000
But human abilities have their limits—

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.750
Are you living together with her?

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.460
Wait, that's what you're frustrated about?

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:40.590
You sacrifice yourself to a demon
to defeat demons.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.350
What will you have left afterward?

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.480
It's all right, Ayano.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:52.610
I don't intend to throw everything out.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.030
I've thought about escape plans.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:59.530
MISS KISARA

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:59.530
CONTRACT

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.530
Simplifying the ritual?

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:05.910
I'll need your power many times from now on.
So, I want to make the ritual procedure a bit simpler,

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:09.000
so that we can make a contract quickly
if we both consent.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.380
I need to make a contract to do that.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.090
So thick.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.460
Oh, there really isn't much written here.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:23.850
BASIC ORDERING CONTRACT:
THIS CONTRACT BETWEEN
SHU OGATA AND KISARA
IS MADE TO PROVIDE
THE FOLLOWING SERVICES.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.720
I just wrote the contents
of all the rituals we've been doing.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:23.850
Every single one, without omissions
nor mistakes, in full detail.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:29.100
I'll perform the ritual six hours from now,
so at least casually read through it.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:41.450
Supplement 263?

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:44.950
It's not here.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.580
This is...

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:52.830
it.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.540
DURING A RITUAL, IF THE FORMER PRAYS TO GOD
WITH FOLDED HANDS, IT WILL BE CONSIDERED
CANCELLATION OF CONTRACT AND THE LATTER
WILL NOT BE PROVIDED MEMORIES FROM THE FORMER.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.540
SUPPLEMENT 263: CONDITIONS AND PROCEDURE
FOR CANCELLATION OF CONTRACT

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:08.390
After this ritual is complete, any further contracts
won't need magical circles, either.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:09.640
I know that.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.140
Then, let's begin.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:24.910
Huh?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.920
This ends the ritual, doesn't it?

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.880
H-H-Hold on a second!
What was that procedure?

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:46.260
Huh? You always did this when you made
contracts with other humans, right?

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.810
No, those weren't contracts!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:53.850
Besides, I followed the procedure written
in the contract, so there aren't any issues.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.020
Written contract?

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.240
ARTICLE 1 - ACTIVATION OF CONTRACT:
WHEN THE LIPS OF THE FORMER
AND THE LATTER TOUCH...
THE RESTRICTION ON ALL POWERS WILL BE LIFTED

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.240
It's been overwritten!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:05.530
Can it be that Supplement 263 also was—

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:08.450
What's wrong?
Is there something wrong?

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:15.330
It'll be a pleasure to work with you...

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.340
Shu.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:48.200
Contract cancellation is something
we decide on our end, human.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.740
Let's see.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.330
How about we hold hands
with interlocking fingers?

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:58.750
INTERLOCKING FINGERS

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:09.350
Kisara... You...

